e action in Italian East Africa during the Second Italo-Abyssinian War, performing bombing, strafing, reconnaissance, and transport missions, often in the absence of significant air opposition. While armed with defensive machine guns and a respectable bomb load, the Ca.133 was equally vital as a utility aircraft, with variants configured for troop transport or as air ambulances. Although slow and vulnerable to modern fighters, its versatility ensured a long career, with over 500 units built and active service continuing throughout Africa and the Mediterranean during WWII."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Homefront","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardEnterPlay","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCovertCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCovertCardSpawned"],"historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/CAPRONI_CA_133.CAPRONI_CA_133","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_caproni_ca_133_photo","SourceString":"A Caproni Ca.133. Date unknown.","LocalizedString":"A Caproni Ca.133. Date unknown."},"blowUpExplosion":{"ObjectName":"ParticleSystem'P_ExplosionAircraftM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Explosions/Medium/Aircraft/P_ExplosionAircraftM.193"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeMedium_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeMedium.0"},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackBomber.BP_AttackBomber_C","SubPathString":""},"threat_level":0.4},"variables":[{"name":"CardPlayed","type":"UBaseCardObject*","direction":"in"}],"functions":[{"name":"ExecuteUbergraph_card_unit_caproni_ca_133","owner":"card_unit_caproni_ca_133_C","params":[{"name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"pure":false,"event":false,"flags":"FUNC_Final | FUNC_UbergraphFunction","locals":[{"name